# Do not commit .env. The public site reads secrets from the platform dashboard.
# Owner sets DATABASE_URL (prod connection string of creator-review-slides only).
# Owner sets BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD once (at least 10 characters). The server stores a
# scrypt hash and a session secret in that project's database and then ignores this value.
# Optional advanced pair. Set both or neither. Do not set only one.
# EDITOR_PASSWORD_HASH=
# SESSION_SECRET=
# Local HTTP tests only. Never set this on the deployed app.
# ALLOW_INSECURE_COOKIES=1
